Value ADDRESS (\S+?)
Value PORT (\d+)
Value VRF (\S+)
Value Filldown GROUP (\S+)

Start
  ^TACACS\+ server\s+:\s+${ADDRESS}/${PORT}(?:\s+\(vrf\s+${VRF}\))?\s*$$ -> Record
  ^TACACS\+ server-group:\s+${GROUP}\s*$$ -> Group

Group
  ^\s+\d+:\s+${ADDRESS}/${PORT}(?:\s+\(vrf\s+${VRF}\))?\s*$$ -> Record
  ^TACACS\+ server-group:\s+${GROUP}\s*$$
  ^\S -> Start

# Every row is recorded explicitly: no implicit record at the end, which would emit a row holding
# only the Filldown values.
EOF
